            <div xml:id="m-96ba5132-2139-44c6-b6ef-9df1bbe27256">
              <lg xml:id="m-bb0d2638-f571-485e-8f7b-a715d317d5fe">
                <l xml:id="m-60909686-9a6c-4128-8b4e-30d34fa6b5e7" facs="#m-e7656ff3-1dc9-4a27-a308-21cf0442cbeb" label="ambiguous">March 19.</l><l xml:id="m-b0fdb0b1-8654-4c34-ba52-50f82716c6d3" facs="#m-84275696-cde9-4727-bea9-c61f34e10137" label="ambiguous">1401</l><l xml:id="m-e7c74b76-0dec-40d7-aa2e-b0c68348ed7d" facs="#m-83a5feb7-fa11-48fc-929b-4b2a5b3c1d6d" label="lyrics-like">bri-el a Dé-o</l><l xml:id="m-3ab288b4-5a82-400e-9ac1-1240fa79ef1f" facs="#m-a7941222-2291-4830-9066-a11f06a2b3b5" label="lyrics-like">ad Vírginem desponsá-tam vi-ro, cú-i</l><l xml:id="m-f39e9a83-662c-4ff6-bc75-0207cc4b31ee" facs="#m-2583fdc5-d9eb-4903-8f22-10038bf25d55" label="lyrics-like">nómen éxrat Jóseph, de dómo Dávid: et nómen Virgi-nis</l><l xml:id="m-1fe5e152-85ab-496f-87d1-070cf164725b" facs="#m-20b63285-f56c-4844-b9ce-ef1bbf72bb4b" label="ambiguous">3. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-29b9d49f-652f-48ea-9dff-04412e03e3a6" facs="#m-bcab81f5-39ab-4e1a-b57c-b637d7b8a2ac" label="ambiguous">3. a2</l><l xml:id="m-2b21b53c-5eca-4f9b-a340-2430a83835a1" facs="#m-5765610d-aabf-4ce1-9989-e9b1b39c5bb9" label="ambiguous">v</l><l xml:id="m-8d84060a-aa94-4c51-bdcc-2f79b1c73bc0" facs="#m-6b8a5099-1f0d-4872-916e-154230f4273c" label="lyrics-like">UM ésset</l><l xml:id="m-63dfb19f-b68d-4bbc-b659-937564fcd175" facs="#m-9f86f728-9c8f-432b-aefa-c507eea1e642" label="lyrics-like">Ma-rí-a. P. T. Alle-lú-ia. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-64eb1dd4-e569-416c-93bd-e689c3c25c60" facs="#m-9f50d8a2-21fd-48e7-ac4b-fd2ca20ef96a" label="ambiguous">M</l><l xml:id="m-5f673cc8-af78-442e-bc56-6c59d83cc722" facs="#m-b62f564d-6661-4e2f-8aa7-b29d94f0b5d2" label="lyrics-like">desponsá-ta “Má-ter Jé-su Ma-rí- a Jó-seph, ántequam con¬</l><l xml:id="m-56dac565-8d5c-42d1-9114-be0b9f93960e" facs="#m-63cb7df1-6f43-4996-b946-1cc742494d65" label="lyrics-like">ve-ní-rent, invénta est in ú-te-ro há¬ bens de Spí¬ ri-tu</l><l xml:id="m-0ec1d6e3-f4c0-4bb7-b4c8-2ba8a085eda1" facs="#m-e0ed0e95-dee9-41be-a5a3-b28cf16bfa72" label="ambiguous">4. Ant.E</l><l xml:id="m-3489fcee-f1eb-445c-83fa-7c37329c298d" facs="#m-d334b657-f426-40f7-99f9-bd824b229843" label="ambiguous">4.E</l><l xml:id="m-423cbce7-1b29-465e-9c33-b9a8dd3a735e" facs="#m-84b95f52-48d5-4686-9d18-b9bf825f0b31" label="lyrics-like">Sáncto. P.T. Alle-lú-ia. Eu o u a e d Oseph vir</l><l xml:id="m-26fdc904-dde7-4f20-9114-e3dc38c53338" facs="#m-0c79e0e9-ba48-4046-be55-dd990220747f" label="lyrics-like">é-jus, cum ésset jústus, et nóllet é-am tradúcere, vó-lu-it</l><l xml:id="m-7b0e2c33-4d2a-4fb8-8379-94b3bc63e0ff" facs="#m-6c222515-ba05-4499-ba32-4e476e57aa11" label="lyrics-like">occúlte dimitte-re é¬ am. P.T. Alle-lú-ia. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-813d0bd5-2d17-4f14-907c-58ff6a0c0dd7" facs="#m-21653a83-b597-420b-b0fb-2abae397d4f4" label="ambiguous">5. Ant.a</l><l xml:id="m-efc0c18b-2a33-4fd4-a8e5-63580449c87b" facs="#m-bb81e66f-ff4c-42c7-9444-f3f28da1dca2" label="ambiguous">5.a</l><l xml:id="m-7f34a32f-66e0-4005-991d-640a2ef5c789" facs="#m-e4ef8c35-503f-40b3-ada4-5ca235e92427" label="lyrics-like">Nge-lus Dómi-ni"“appáru-it Jóseph, dí-cens: Jó¬</l><l xml:id="m-02589959-de75-43e0-87a1-4cd9a2a32411" facs="#m-da6a577b-8c42-4789-a9ee-a5932d04c352" label="lyrics-like">seph fí-li Dávid, nó-li timé-re accípe-re Marí¬am cónju¬</l></lg>
